scenario: learning_period_setting
The install-wide setting is 2 days; one key keeps it, one has a policy of 5 minutes and one has none at all. The same new country on day 1 is raised for the key whose period is 5 minutes and the one with none, and only recorded for the other two until their periods are over; on day 3 the install-wide one is over.

